# Advanced Bestiary -- Spells
SOURCELONG:Advanced Bestiary	SOURCESHORT:AB	SOURCEWEB:http://greenronin.com/	SOURCEDATE:2014-09
# ORIGINAL ENTRY: Seb Quenet
# ORIGINAL ENTRY DATE: 2026/09/20

###Block: Appendix A -- New Feats, Spells and Class Features
Create Manimal	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	CLASSES:Druid=6|Sorcerer,Wizard=7	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S, M (bones and viscera of the specific type of animal and any humanoid)	CASTTIME:1 day	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Animal touched	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Will negates	SPELLRES:Yes	DESC:As awaken, but the animal gains the manimal template instead of the usual changes from the awaken spell.	SOURCEPAGE:p.297
Create Verminoid	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	CLASSES:Druid=5|Sorcerer,Wizard=7	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S	CASTTIME:1 day	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Mindless vermin touched	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Will negates	SPELLRES:Yes	DESC:Grants the verminoid template to the touched mindless vermin. On the touch the target is immediately empowered with the benefits of the template and knows how to use all its abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298
Empower Undead	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	CLASSES:Cleric,Sorcerer,Wizard=6	SCHOOL:Necromancy	DESCRIPTOR:Evil	COMPS:V, S, M (a gem worth at least 10 gp that spent the night in the body of an undead creature)	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Undead creature touched	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Will negates	SPELLRES:Yes	DESC:Grants the negative-energy charged template to the touched undead. On the touch the target is immediately empowered with the benefits of the template and knows how to use all its abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298
Flora to Fauna	TYPE:Arcane.Divine	CLASSES:Druid,Sorcerer,Wizard=7	SCHOOL:Transmutation	COMPS:V, S, M (freshly killed animal flesh weighing at least one-half that of the plant)	CASTTIME:1 day	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:Plant touched	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:Fortitude negates	SPELLRES:Yes	DESC:On casting, the flesh used as a material component is absorbed by the plant touched, permanently transforming it into a flesh plant.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298
Thorn Walk	TYPE:Divine	CLASSES:Ranger=3|Druid=4	SCHOOL:Conjuration	SUBSCHOOL:Teleportation	COMPS:V, S, DF	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Personal	TARGETAREA:You	DURATION:(CASTERLEVEL) hours or until expended; see text	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	DESC:As tree stride, but the caster can only travel through trees that grow thorns, brambles or similar growth. The caster can also move through a wall of thorns or similar thorn-related effect without taking damage or suffering any impairment.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298
Undead Plants	TYPE:Divine	CLASSES:Druid=4	SCHOOL:Necromancy	DESCRIPTOR:Evil	COMPS:V, S, M	CASTTIME:1 standard action	RANGE:Touch	TARGETAREA:One or more plant corpses touched	DURATION:Instantaneous	SAVEINFO:None	SPELLRES:No	DESC:As animate dead, but it affects only creatures with the plant type. Plant skeletons are made from the hardened stalks and bark of the plant but are otherwise hollow. Plant zombies look much as they did before but are rotting, and may carry fungal growths or dangerous molds.	SOURCEPAGE:p.298

